# Normalize line endings to LF on commit; checked-out files use native
# endings. Kills the cross-OS CRLF noise for good.
* text=auto eol=lf

# PDFs are binary: extraction text-layers and compiled CVs must never be
# merged as text. (Only docs/ApplyOS-setup-guide.pdf is tracked, via a
# tight gitignore negation.)
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
